      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780676468060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what if u just collect up all the nodes\nin order into a list, remake the BST\nfrom there and compare them. they\nmust be the same, if not its invalid\nthat works and its O(n) right??\nbut like i feel like theres a better\nsolution\nlike if that works, there should be a\nsimpler way",
      "fontSize": 25.326449283717515,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what if u just collect up all the nodes in order into a list, remake the BST from there and compare them. they must be the same, if not its invalid\nthat works and its O(n) right??\nbut like i feel like theres a better solution\nlike if that works, there should be a simpler way",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
